From an accounting perspective, an invoice issue date on the date it is generated, regardless of when the payment is made, as long as there is proof linking the payment to that specific invoice.

{quote}that fleet WILL NOT receive these amounts to their account as it was already added in previous files? So we need to avoid the double payment for sure.{quote}

As mentioned, they will receive duplicate payments. If you want to prevent that, add a *second row in the same file* using the *opposite subtype*. Here is what you need to put on the second row.

* Set {{adjustment_type = fee}}
* Set {{adjustment_subtype = other_fees}}
* Set {{agent_type = fleet}}
* Set {{agent_id = fleet ID}}
* Set Title = preventing double payment
* Set comment = to prevent double payment of branding bonus

